    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 0b76f1308344b3142becca4ddad7cb3b132721e1 -->\n**Delta review (M5, since 4ce7dbe7): ready for the maintainer to merge (after #999).**\n\nThe new commits are ff6919b5, a merge of upstream/main (`git show --remerge-diff` is empty, so no hand edits), and 0b76f130, the requested fix: `posted_gates/mod.rs`'s `VerifyContext` sets main's `model_excess: 0.0`. The decision file now records that Engrave mode skips the region law, so a trace golden is judged for depth and not for an off-boundary path. The author reports solid_law_goldens 5/5 and clippy clean on this head, matching the review's local run with the same one-line fix. The rest of the full review at 4ce7dbe7 stands.",
